  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>And,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p><p>Solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/205d4514-e9b7-404e-9cdc-86e2541f5927-9896296.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 250px;\" /></p><p>Required area</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>dx</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>225</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>45</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>225</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>99</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>225</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>72</mn></math></p>",
